 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Mixed signals here. One says sit on it, the other says keep moving. Which is it? Then sit on something tall. A chair, a table, anything that gets your feet off the ground. Yes, leaning forward or leaning back too much puts strain on the lower back. Try to keep your ears about level with your knees. Try taking short walks around the room every half hour or so. It gets your back from getting too stiff.",
